---
// apps/frontend/site/src/lib/components/sections/your_ai.astro
---

<section id="your-ai" class="scroll-mt-24 border-b border-border/70 bg-card/40">
  <div
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-6 py-16 md:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-20"
  >
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-brand dark:text-brand-soft">Your campaign. Your setup.</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-[1.08] md:text-5xl">
        Choose your AI.<br><em>Keep your saves.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
        No account required for local play. Your saves stay on your device.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/faq"
        class="mt-4 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-sm text-foreground underline decoration-border underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-brand"
        >Setup &amp; privacy questions <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
      >
    </div>
    <dl class="divide-y divide-border">
      <div class="pb-5">
        <dt class="font-medium">Local AI</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Run a text model on your hardware. Offline play requires installed local AI and cached
          content; initial downloads need a connection.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="py-5">
        <dt class="font-medium">Cloud AI</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Use your own provider and key. Dialogue is sent to that provider; internet access and
          possible provider charges apply.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-5">
        <dt class="font-medium">Image &amp; voice</dt>
        <dd class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          Optional ways to enrich the experience. Text AI is the only required AI service.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
